  "historyNote": "#6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #8692, INTERIM, eff 7-27-06, EXPIRES: 2-2-07; ss by #8808, eff 1-24-07; ss by #10805, eff 3-28-15; ss by #14303, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
